  problem_summary: |
    $f(x)=\frac{x+4}{x-1},g(x)=\frac{2x}{x-2}$·$(g^{-1}\circ f)^{-1}(4)$.
  solution_summary: |
    $(g^{-1}\circ f)^{-1}=f^{-1}\circ g$. $g(4)=8/2=4$. $f^{-1}(4)$: $f(x)=4\to x+4=4x-4\to x=8/3$. 답 $8/3$ (④).
  category: 역함수 합성 값
  tier: star_3
  mechanism_primary: 역함수-합성-공식
  insight_type: 통찰형
  depth: 2

